Dear <%= @mentor.name %>,

We hope you're doing well and looking forward to 39C3!

This is a friendly reminder to reach out to your mentees if you haven't already. Your mentees are: <%= @mentor.group.mentees.map { |m| m.name }.join(', ') %>.

If you've already made contact, please let us know. Remember to CC us at 39c3-chaosmentors@cccv.de when you write to your mentees, so we know that contact has been established.

If you have any questions or need support, feel free to reach out to us anytime.


Your Chaosmentors Team
